  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ey, chaval<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀa!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100450079002C002000630068006100760061006C00100003110000FF010000610021001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Tienes un momento?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF005400690065006E0065007300200075006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F003F001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Perdón por sospechar de ti y hacerte tantas\npreguntas con lo del Goomy aquella vez.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Era solo eso. Te he visto pasar y quería\ndisculparme.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450072006100200073006F006C006F002000650073006F002E00200054006500200068006500200076006900730074006F002000700061007300610072002000790020007100750065007200ED0061000A00640069007300630075006C007000610072006D0065002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ahora mismo estoy muy ocupada con lo del\nrobo en el Museo de Arte de Luminalia.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Suena grave!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005300750065006E006100200067007200610076006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Puedo ayudar en algo?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0050007500650064006F002000610079007500640061007200200065006E00200061006C0067006F003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, no, tranquil<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa. En realidad, no es más que\nun simulacro. No es un robo real.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En la Policía, hacemos simulacros con frecuencia\npara entrenarnos. Esta vez se trata de recrear un<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nrobo en el Museo de Arte de Luminalia.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 145
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un momento...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F002E002E002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ahora que lo pienso, podrías serme de ayuda.\nSé de sobra que habilidad no te falta.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Me gustaría que hicieras de ladr<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿ̂ónona en\nel simulacro!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D0065002000670075007300740061007200ED006100200071007500650020006800690063006900650072006100730020006400650020006C00610064007200100003110000FF030200F3006E006F006E006100200065006E000A0065006C002000730069006D0075006C006100630072006F0021001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ven a hablar conmigo cuando estés list<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00560065006E002000610020006800610062006C0061007200200063006F006E006D00690067006F0020006300750061006E0064006F002000650073007400E900730020006C00690073007400100003110000FF0101006F0061002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Estás list<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa para el robo? Bueno, para\nel simulacro. Ya me entiendes.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡List<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004C00690073007400100003110000FF0101006F006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un momento",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El éxito de la operación depende de ti, chaval<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀa.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006C002000E9007800690074006F0020006400650020006C00610020006F00700065007200610063006900F3006E00200064006500700065006E00640065002000640065002000740069002C002000630068006100760061006C00100003110000FF01000061002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Estupendo. Empecemos entonces.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500730074007500700065006E0064006F002E00200045006D0070006500630065006D006F007300200065006E0074006F006E006300650073002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Te explico en qué consiste tu papel: en primer\nlugar, debes acceder por la entrada principal.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nLuego, sube al primer piso y roba el atuendo de\nlos antiguos sinnohítas que verás allí.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nLa misión de los agentes de Policía es detenerte,\npara lo que te desafiarán a un combate Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 290
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ten en cuenta que te enfrentas a la flor y nata\ndel cuerpo de Policía de Ciudad Luminalia.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y ahora adelante, baja de la azotea para dar\ncomienzo al simulacro.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059002000610068006F007200610020006100640065006C0061006E00740065002C002000620061006A00610020006400650020006C006100200061007A006F007400650061002000700061007200610020006400610072000A0063006F006D00690065006E007A006F00200061006C002000730069006D0075006C006100630072006F002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Se te ha olvidado la ruta? Primero, accede\nal museo por la entrada principal.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Alto ahí! ¡Detente, o me enfrentaré a ti con mis\nPokémon!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMi frase es la mejor de todo el guion.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
